# Build output and the packaged release payloads. `dist/` is what the build step
# uploads; `release/` is what scripts/release-artifacts.sh writes (a ~20 MB
# tarball that embeds a CPython). Neither is source, and an un-ignored `release/`
# is one `git add -A` away from committing a 20 MB binary to history.
dist/
release/



